# Day 3 — Say Again. 23 August. High cloud, breezy. The supply truck; wind at the tarn; the cabin.

call D3_AM
  day 3
  time 06:20-12:00
  kind report
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. Morning. Readings? Over.
choice
  > "Dry {dry}, wet {wet}. Wind {wind}." if obs_am set gave_readings -> read
  > "Give me five minutes." -> five
  > [say nothing] -> quiet
node read
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Dry bulb {dry}, wet {wet}. Humidity {rh}. Wind {wind}. Fuel stick {fuel}.
DOT  Copy. Wind's coming up. You'll feel it on the catwalk by lunch. Over.
goto plan
node five
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Give me five minutes.
DOT  Augie used to say that. Then he'd call at noon. I'll guess. Breezy. Over.
goto plan
node quiet
DOT  I can hear you breathing, Kestrel. That counts as a reading. Over.
node plan
DOT  High cloud, breezy from the west-southwest. Fire danger moderate.
DOT  Supply truck at the gate around noon. Don't make Hal wait. He talks to his truck, and his truck is a bad listener. Basin out.
do errand Meet the supply truck at the trailhead gate around noon.

call D3_SUPPLY
  day 3
  needs supply_today
  after D3_AM
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. Hal says you weren't at the gate. Hal says it with feeling.
THEO Basin, Kestrel. I've got the box. There are peaches in it.
DOT  Peaches are from me. Don't tell Augie. He always wanted peaches and I never sent him any.
choice
  > "Why not?" -> why
  > "Thank you." -> thanks
  > [say nothing] -> quiet
node why
THEO Why not?
DOT  Twenty-two years, and he never once asked. I was waiting for him to ask.
goto out
node thanks
THEO Thank you, Basin. Really.
DOT  Don't make it a thing.
goto out
node quiet
DOT  Eat them cold. It's the only way.
node out
do errand_done
DOT  Basin out.

call D3_WIND
  day 3
  where area:tarn
  after D3_AM
  garble
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. Wind's... — ...this afternoon, so... — ...the catwalk, over.
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Say again?
DOT  ...said the wind... — ...gusting to... — ...keep your... — ...over.
THEO Say again, Basin. All after "wind."
DOT  ...ty miles... — ...hat on... — ...copy?
THEO Say again! I can't — I can't hear you!
DOT  ...
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. You're breaking up. Get off the water and try me again. Over.
choice
  > "Wind's loud up here. Sorry." -> wind
  > "Left ear's not great. Sorry." set told_ear_early -> ear
  > [say nothing] -> quiet
node wind
THEO Wind's loud up here. Sorry. I didn't mean to bark.
DOT  You didn't bark. You should hear the crews. Gusts to thirty this afternoon. Hold on to your hat. Basin out.
end
node ear
THEO Left ear's not great. Sorry. I didn't mean to bark.
DOT  ...Copy. Noted. I'll talk slower, and you tell me when I'm mumbling. Deal?
THEO Deal.
DOT  Gusts to thirty this afternoon. Hold on to your hat. Basin out.
end
node quiet
DOT  ...Gusts to thirty, Kestrel. Hold on to something. Basin out.

call D3_CABIN
  day 3-10
  needs cabin_entered
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. You found the cabin.
THEO How do you know?
DOT  Because you've gone quiet in a different way. He'd go down there when the tower got too loud.
DOT  A tower's never loud, Theo. That's what I told him.
choice
  > "What did he say?" -> said
  > "It's a good room." -> room
  > [say nothing] -> quiet
node said
THEO What did he say?
DOT  He said, "Dot, you've never been in one." Which was fair. Basin out.
end
node room
THEO It's a good room. It smells like coffee and dust.
DOT  That's him. That's exactly him. Basin out.
end
node quiet
DOT  Take your time down there. Basin out.

call D3_EVE
  day 3
  time 16:30-18:00
  retry 20:00
  kind report
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. Evening readings.
choice
  > "Dry {dry}, wet {wet}. Wind {wind}." if obs_pm set gave_readings -> read
  > "Didn't get to the box." -> notyet
node read
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Dry {dry}, wet {wet}. Humidity {rh}. Wind {wind}.
DOT  Copy. Wind's dropping. Eat a peach. Basin out.
end
node notyet
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Didn't get to the box.
DOT  Wind's dropping, if it helps. Basin out.
